# Document Comment and Search API Tests

# Test comment endpoints
@baseUrl = http://localhost:5062

### Get all comments for a document (assuming document ID 1 exists)
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/comments/document/1

### Create a new comment
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/comments
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "documentId": 1,
  "authorName": "Test User",
  "content": "This is a test comment on the document. It contains important feedback about the content.",
  "position": "page-1-paragraph-2"
}

### Create a reply to the comment (use the comment ID from the previous response)
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/comments
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "documentId": 1,
  "authorName": "Another User",
  "content": "I agree with your feedback. This is a reply to the comment above.",
  "parentCommentId": 1
}

### Update a comment (use appropriate comment ID)
PUT {{baseUrl}}/api/comments/1
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "content": "This is an updated version of my original comment. I've added more details."
}

### Get comment statistics for a document
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/comments/document/1/statistics

### Get recent comments across all documents
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/comments/recent?limit=10

### Get replies to a specific comment
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/comments/1/replies

### Test Search Endpoints

### Check search service health
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/search/health

### Create search index
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/search/index/create

### Search documents with basic query
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/search/documents
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "query": "test",
  "page": 1,
  "pageSize": 10,
  "sortBy": "uploadDate",
  "sortDirection": "desc",
  "enableHighlight": true
}

### Search with filters
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/search/documents
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "query": "document",
  "tags": ["Important"],
  "fileTypes": ["pdf"],
  "processedOnly": true,
  "page": 1,
  "pageSize": 20,
  "enableHighlight": true
}

### Get search suggestions
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/search/suggestions?query=doc&maxSuggestions=5

### Get search aggregations
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/search/aggregations

### Get similar documents (use actual document ID)
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/search/similar/1?maxResults=5

### Rebuild search index
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/search/index/rebuild

### Test Tag Management

### Create a new tag
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/tags
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Comments Test",
  "description": "Tag for testing comment functionality",
  "color": "#ff6b6b"
}

### Get all tags
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/tags

### Test Document Upload (for testing comments)

### Upload a test document
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/documents/upload
Content-Type: multipart/form-data; boundary=----boundary

------boundary
Content-Disposition: form-data; name="file"; filename="test.txt"
Content-Type: text/plain

This is a test document for testing the comment functionality.
It contains some sample content that can be used to test OCR and AI processing.

The document has multiple paragraphs and should be indexed for search.
------boundary
Content-Disposition: form-data; name="title"

Test Document for Comments
------boundary
Content-Disposition: form-data; name="tagIds"

[1, 6]
------boundary--

### Get document details to verify upload
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/documents/1

### Get all documents
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/documents?page=1&pageSize=10

### Delete a comment (use appropriate comment ID)
# DELETE {{baseUrl}}/api/comments/1

### Delete search index (use with caution)
# DELETE {{baseUrl}}/api/search/index
